data: {"id": "d1e94db5e24f45df-final", "run_id": "d1e94db5e24f45df", "seq": 1370, "ts_ms": 1789072756747, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl处于CrashLoopBackOff状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: CrashLoopBackOff (app) | 确定 Pod 处于异常重启循环状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `event.message`: \"Back-off restarting failed container app\" | 确证 Kubelet 因容器持续异常而触发退避重启 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason`: Error | 确认应用进程非正常退出 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.last_exit_code`: 78 | 提供应用退出的具体错误代码 |\n| 5 | Logging | elasticsearch | `pattern`: {event: \"http_request\", level: \"error\", message: \"CONFIG_MISSING\", http_status: 500, path: \"/work\"} (8次) | 证明应用接收到请求并因配置缺失返回 500 错误 |\n| 6 | Tracing | deepflow | `flow`: GET /work → 500 (src: 172.16.104.8 → dst: 172.16.104.63) | 从流量层面佐证应用对外提供请求时处理失败 |\n| 7 | Tracing | tempo | `span`: {trace_id: \"a358165e4c5df7b2882c057473693f30\", attributes: {aiops.observed_mode: \"config_missing_exit\", http.response.status_code: 500}} | 结合日志 TraceID，精准追踪到单次请求因 CONFIG_MISSING 触发退出逻辑 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n1.  证据 1-4 与 6 共同确认了 Pod 处于由内部错误导致的 CrashLoopBackOff 状态；\n2.  证据 5 (日志) 与 证据 7 (追踪) 建立了因果链：应用启动后，在处理 GET /work 请求时，检测到 `CONFIG_MISSING` 并返回 500 状态码；\n3.  证据 7 中的 `aiops.observed_mode: config_missing_exit` 与日志中的 `CONFIG_MISSING` 模式一致，直接解释了证据 4 中 `exit_code: 78` 的触发原因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用未找到预期 CONFIG → 处理请求时触发 CONFIG_MISSING 错误并退出 (exit code 78) → Kubelet 持续重启异常容器 → Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：\n应用运行逻辑强制要求在 `CONFIG` 可用时才提供服务。由于缺失该配置，应用在处理请求（如 `GET /work`）时抛出 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误并直接以非零退出码（78）退出，导致 Kubelet 反复重启容器，最终形成 CrashLoopBackOff。\n\n**支持证据**：\n- **日志**显示连续 8 次出现 `CONFIG_MISSING` 错误模式并伴随 `http_status: 500`（证据 5）；\n- **Tracing** 明确记录了 `config_missing_exit` 模式及 `exit_code: 78` 的退出行为（证据 7）；\n- **K8s 状态**确认容器因 Error 退出并处于 CrashLoopBackOff（证据 1-4）。\n\n**未知项**：\n- 缺失的具体 CONFIG 来源（是环境变量、ConfigMap 还是 Secret）在当前证据中无法直接确认。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 66.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl: 66.6s (Evidence 57.4s, RCA 9.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 98.311, "metrics": {"run_id": "d1e94db5e24f45df", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 98.31733393669128, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 98317.33393669128, "llm_calls": 13, "llm_duration_ms": 92811.60044670105, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 15, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 12266.59369468689, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 5098.956823348999}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19489.205598831177, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 66624.54891204834, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12180.471897125244, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

